Subject: [PATCH] runtime: hash the hot memos with the runtime's fast hasher

The per-draw memo lookups (a state's variant and bind-plan Lrus, the pass
start's announced reads, the kept render passes) hashed their keys with the
standard SipHash-1-3, which the profile showed at every draw. These keys are
the runtime's own small structures, the same class key_hash.rs already
serves, so their maps take KeyHasher; nothing else changes.

---
--- a/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pipeline/memo.rs
+++ b/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/pipeline/memo.rs
@@ -22,7 +22,8 @@
